"ziyuan-2012:8F66:869956813d6e\",\n    \"kind\": \"ocr\",\n    \"title\": \"Verify 字源 scan finding for 8F66\",\n    \"details\": \"[SCAN VERIFICATION REQUIRED] 字源 PDF p.1260, printed p.1245, quoted occurrence beginning 郭沫若《卜辞通纂》：“二车字一作…”. The book scan visibly contains embedded rare glyph drawings in this quotation; their exact scalar identities cannot be established from the typography/OCR. The quotation’s surrounding discussion is legible, but do not replace the drawings with guessed Unicode.\",\n    \"verification\": \"Check the identified printed page and exact scan span; correct source-bound OCR or record an unresolved glyph identity.\",\n    \"evidence\": [\n      \"Source job: /home/catalin/hanzi-etymology-dict/runs/fresh-three-slot-smoke-20261004/ziyuan-2012/8F66\",\n      \"Research output: initial-followup/research/result.json\"\n    ]\n  }\n]\n\ninitial-followup/research/result.json [\n  \"[SCAN VERIFICATION REQUIRED] 字源 PDF p.1260, printed p.1245, quoted occurrence beginning 郭沫若《卜辞通纂》：“二车字一作…”. The book scan visibly contains embedded rare glyph drawings in this quotation; their exact scalar identities cannot be established from the typography/OCR. The quotation’s surrounding discussion is legible, but do not replace the drawings with guessed Unicode.\",\n  \"The book’s claims about reduced forms and the particular wheel-and-axle interpretation are the author’s analysis; the inspected external summaries support variable pictorial forms and reduction but do not independently settle the identification of every reduced historical shape.\",\n  \"The contemporary MOE entry inspected was Traditional Chinese 車. A verified official Unicode entry supplies 车’s kMandarin reading but not its current dictionary sense; current simplified-form sense documentation was not separately opened.\",\n  \"The BNU URL cited in the supplied dossier resolves to an unrelated essay in this inspection, so no Sui-or-earlier date for cursive 车 is independently verified here. The 1956 standardization claim is supported only by the inspected transcription after the official Ministry page failed to open.\"\n]\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
